{"slug":"cop-craft","ad":"Cop Craft","adEn":"Cop Craft","yil":2019,"puan":64,"format":"TV","durum":"FINISHED","sezon":"SUMMER","sure":23,"poster":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1365/103219.jpg","banner":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/106893-1baPXVK1USJe.jpg","banner4k":null,"ozet":"The story is set in San Teresa City on the fictional Pacific island of Kariaena. The \"buddy police action\" series follows the detective Kei Matoba and the alternate-world knight Tirana.\n\n15 years ago, an unknown hyperspace gate opened over the Pacific. Beyond this gate lies Reto Semaani, a strange alternate world where fairies and demons live.\n\nSan Teresa City — a city where over two million immigrants live from both worlds. As a result, there are the haves and the have-nots. Here is the world's newest \"city of dreams.\" But in the shadow of the chaos, crime is rampant: drugs, prostitution, and weapon trafficking. The detectives who stand up to these heinous crimes are in the San Teresa City Police. When the detective Kei Matoba and the alternate-world knight Tirana — two individuals who differ in gender, personality, and even world of origin — meet, an incident erupts. Two worlds. Two justices. From this, the curtain rises on a buddy police action story!\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)","turler":["Aksiyon","Fantastik","Bilim Kurgu","Isekai","Dedektif","Suç"],"iliski":[],"seri":null,"fragman":{"site":"youtube","id":"C3Fy8iYOQ7A"},"yasal":[{"a":"Hulu","u":"https://www.hulu.com/series/cop-craft-da0b3b7a-2bb3-4fc8-b6ce-9ed7f30e3e45"},{"a":"Amazon Prime Video","u":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VM98CLR/"},{"a":"YouTube","u":"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLwLSw1_eDZl27k9-B8hZh98KmD8R6Zwnq"},{"a":"Crunchyroll","u":"https://www.crunchyroll.com/cop-craft"}],"kaynakSayisi":69,"bolumSayisi":12,"bolumler":[{"n":1,"no":"1","ad":"1. Bölüm","slug":"cop-craft-1-bolum","ks":10,"ekip":[{"g":"Akatsuki","e":"Ece Milay / www.AkatsukiSubs.com / www.fb.com/a